                    "reason": "The generated V3 S3 client keeps the {Bucket} label in the path of virtual-hosted requests (S3GeneratedApiTest#syncGetObjectPutsTheBucketInTheHostOnly is disabled), so Transfer Manager requests name the bucket twice; a codegen/protocol defect outside the library."
                },
